WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:05,100
Don't worry, as long as you obey, I will go out and help you find supplies

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:10,640
If you establish a sect at this time, you can become a religious group

3
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,360
There's no need to make it so complicated with a bunch of cannon fodder.

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:19,900
As long as I use a piece of moldy steamed bun, I can make them treat me as more dear to me than my biological father.

5
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:27,780
But do you really want to go out?

6
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:32,030
Do you have any supplies at home? Let me go with you too.

7
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:35,580
Don’t worry, the supplies at home are enough to feed you.

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,080
We all have this kind of relationship now

9
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:40,080
Do you think I will still doubt you?
